{
  "Encounter_Brothers_1_and_3": [
    {
      "entryID": 1,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（經過一番角力，你成功將水下的“大物”拉上岸。定睛一看，釣上來的竟是一隻暴跳如雷的翠綠妖怪，而上次被你擊敗的妖怪大哥，也從他身後的水中冒了出來，臉色不善地瞪著你。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 2,
      "actorID": "Kappa3",
      "text": "「大哥，甭跟他廢話！就這小子是吧！？俺們並肩子上，把他打個稀巴爛！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(Kappa3,pic=2);EnableCharacterExpression(1,Kappa3_Anger);",
      "links": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 3,
      "actorID": "Kappa1",
      "text": "[panel=2]「……小子，我承認你有些本事。但你千不該萬不該，奪我財寶。今天，就讓你見識我三弟的厲害！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(Kappa1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(2,Kappa1_Anger);",
      "links": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 4,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=3]「表哥，他們有兩個人……」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);DisableCharacterExpression(2);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=13);",
      "links": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 5,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「正好，省得我一個一個去找。你們兄弟既然到齊了，那就一起上吧！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Anger_2);",
      "links": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 6,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "",
      "Sequence": "BeginCombat(Kappa_Duo_Battle);",
      "links": [
        7,
        11
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥觸發節點：大哥與三弟"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 7,
      "actorID": "Kappa1",
      "text": "[panel=1]「英雄饒命！我們兄弟倆徹底服了！我們再也不敢找您麻煩了！」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(Kappa1,pic=11);",
      "links": [
        8
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥勝利分支"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 8,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "",
      "Sequence": "ModifyData(Player,Money,+500);",
      "links": [
        9
      ],
      "Description": "系統節點：增加金錢"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 9,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=2]「嘻嘻，又是收穫滿滿的一天！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);",
      "links": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 10,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「哈哈，我可真是太強囉，你們走吧，下次歡迎再來送錢啊。」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=1);",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "entryID": 11,
      "actorID": "Kappa3",
      "text": "[panel=2]「大哥，我們走。看來這小子也不過如此。」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
      "links": [
        12
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥失敗分支"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 12,
      "actorID": "Kappa1",
      "text": "[panel=1]「哈哈哈！看到沒！俺三弟一出手，你就變成軟腳蝦了！」",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 13,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（兩隻妖怪耀武揚威一番後，得意洋洋地跳回了河裡。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 14,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=1]「表哥，你還好吧？」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=13);",
      "links": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 15,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「…一時大意！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);",
      "links": []
    }
  ],
  "Encounter_Brother_2": [
    {
      "entryID": 101,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（釣魚結束後，正當你收拾釣具準備離開時，一個身影悄無聲息地出現在你面前，擋住了你的去路。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        102
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 102,
      "actorID": "Kappa2",
      "text": "「哼，你就是那個欺負我大哥和三弟的傢伙？不過，也就到此為止了。今天我要讓你明白，我們兄弟不是好惹的！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(Kappa2,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(1,Kappa2_Anger);",
      "links": [
        103
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 103,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=2]「表哥，這個傢伙看起來…跟前兩個不太一樣。」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=13);",
      "links": [
        104
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 104,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「哦？那你想來試試？」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Anger_2);",
      "links": [
        105
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 105,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "",
      "Sequence": "BeginCombat(Kappa_MidBro_Battle);",
      "links": [
        106,
        115
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥觸發節點：二哥"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 106,
      "actorID": "Kappa2",
      "text": "「可惡…我竟然會輸給你這種…」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(Kappa2,pic=11);",
      "links": [
        107
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥勝利分支"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 107,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（就在此時，河邊水花大作，之前被你擊敗的妖怪大哥和三弟衝了出來，護在二哥身前。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        108
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 108,
      "actorID": "Kappa3",
      "text": "[panel=4]「渾蛋！不准你動我二哥！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(Kappa3,pic=2);EnableCharacterExpression(4,Kappa3_Anger);",
      "links": [
        109
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 109,
      "actorID": "Kappa1",
      "text": "[panel=3]「英雄！英雄請高抬貴手！我二弟性子高傲，多有得罪，還請您大人有大量！我們兄弟三人，再也不敢與您為敵了！」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(4);SetPortrait(Kappa1,pic=11);",
      "links": [
        110
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 110,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（妖怪大哥從懷裡掏出一個更大的錢袋，恭敬地奉上。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        111
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 111,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "",
      "Sequence": "ModifyData(Player,Money,+1000);",
      "links": [
        112
      ],
      "Description": "系統節點：增加金錢"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 112,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=2]「哇！表哥，這次的更多！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);",
      "links": [
        113
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 113,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「罷了。你們兄弟情深，倒也難得。錢我收下，你們走吧。日後好自為之，莫要再為非作歹。」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
      "links": [
        114
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 114,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（妖怪大哥連連道謝，然後扶起仍有些不甘的二哥，拉著還想叫囂的三弟，三兄弟互相攙扶著沉入水中，消失不見。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "entryID": 115,
      "actorID": "Kappa2",
      "text": "「哈哈哈！我還以為有多大本事，原來是個銀樣蠟槍頭！光有蠻力是沒用的。」",
      "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(Kappa2,pic=5);",
      "links": [
        116
      ],
      "Description": "戰鬥失敗分支"
    },
    {
      "entryID": 116,
      "actorID": "MC0",
      "text": "[panel=6]＊（妖怪耀武揚威一番後，得意洋洋地跳回了河裡。）＊",
      "Sequence": "",
      "links": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 117,
      "actorID": "MC8",
      "text": "[panel=2]「表哥，你還好吧？我們…我們還是先回去吧…」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=13);",
      "links": [
        118
      ]
    },
    {
      "entryID": 118,
      "actorID": "MC1",
      "text": "「我…我今天沒吃飽，手軟了！等我吃飽飯，定要牠們好看！」",
      "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);",
      "links": []
    }
  ]
}
